    </DocsPageSectionHeader>
    <DocsPageSectionContent Code="VideoMultipleSourcesExample" Outlined FullWidth>
        <VideoMultipleSourcesExample />
    </DocsPageSectionContent>
</DocsPageSection>

<DocsPageSectionTitle>
    Best practices
</DocsPageSectionTitle>

<UnorderedList>
    <UnorderedListItem>
        Provide a <Code>Poster</Code> and stable <Code>Ratio</Code> when possible to avoid layout movement before media metadata loads.
    </UnorderedListItem>
    <UnorderedListItem>
        Add caption or subtitle <Code>VideoTrack</Code> entries for accessible playback, and identify their language and label.
    </UnorderedListItem>
    <UnorderedListItem>
        Use native media files for simple playback and select HLS or DASH only when the source is a matching streaming manifest.
    </UnorderedListItem>
    <UnorderedListItem>
        YouTube and Vimeo adapter files are served by Blazorise, but their iframe players and media require network access and permission from browser content blockers.
    </UnorderedListItem>
</UnorderedList>

